OL,3,GNEWSABooking system cyber attacks      
OL,4,Aprompt warning                         
OL,6,FOfficials have said they are aware of  
OL,7,Fcyber attacks affecting businesses     
OL,8,Fusing online booking systems.          
OL,10,FThe Office of the Data Protection      
OL,11,FAuthority said customers in Guernsey   
OL,12,Fmay receive social media messages      
OL,13,Frequesting payment which look genuine, 
OL,14,Fbut actually direct money to cyber     
OL,15,Fattackers.                             
OL,17,FThe authority urged people to view its 
OL,18,Fcyber security checklist and issued    
OL,19,Fadvice to islanders if they received an
OL,20,Funexpected payment request.            
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
