OL,3,GNEWSABooking system cyber attacks      
OL,4,Aprompt warning                         
OL,6,FIt is despite the launch of the        
OL,7,FGuernsey Cyber Security Centre, which  
OL,8,Foffers free advice and support to      
OL,9,Fislanders and businesses around cyber  
OL,10,Fthreats.                               
